{
  "$schema": "https://openapi.vercel.sh/vercel.json",
  "//": [
    "There was no vercel.json at all, so every asset came back with Vercel's",
    "default 'public, max-age=0, must-revalidate'. The CDN cached them, but the",
    "browser did not: a returning visitor revalidated all 1.2MB of images on",
    "every single visit. On a high-latency mobile connection that is a round",
    "trip per file before anything paints.",
    "",
    "The rule is: content-hashed filenames get a year and immutable, because a",
    "changed file is a different URL. Unhashed files that ship from /public get",
    "a day with stale-while-revalidate. HTML stays must-revalidate so a deploy",
    "is live immediately."
  ],
  "headers": [
    {
      "source": "/_astro/(.*)",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "Cache-Control",
          "value": "public, max-age=31536000, immutable"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "/fonts/(.*)",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "Cache-Control",
          "value": "public, max-age=31536000, immutable"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "/images/(.*)",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "Cache-Control",
          "value": "public, max-age=86400, stale-while-revalidate=604800"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "/css/(.*)",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "Cache-Control",
          "value": "public, max-age=86400, stale-while-revalidate=604800"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "/(favicon.ico|favicon.svg|apple-touch-icon.png|robots.txt|sitemap.xml)",
      "headers": [
        {
          "key": "Cache-Control",
          "value": "public, max-age=86400, stale-while-revalidate=604800"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "/(.*)",
      "headers": [
        { "key": "X-Content-Type-Options", "value": "nosniff" },
        { "key": "Referrer-Policy", "value": "strict-origin-when-cross-origin" },
        { "key": "X-Frame-Options", "value": "SAMEORIGIN" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
